Description: How much of a track was heard; history, Auto DJ requeue, move buttons
 - ListenTracker: [ChannelN],listened (read only, 0..1), the share of the
   loaded track listened to (the play position's progress while playing at
   up to twice normal speed; jumps and seeks are not counted); reset when a
   track is loaded.
 - History and play count: a playing track counts as played only once
   [Library] HistoryMinListenedPercent (default 10) of it was listened to;
   unloaded before, it is not played. 0: at once (Mixxx's behaviour).
 - Auto DJ: a track the deck got from the queue that is replaced by another
   one before [Auto DJ] RequeuePercent (default 5) of it was heard goes back
   to the top of the queue (below a track waiting in a deck). 0: never.
 - [Library],move_selected_up / move_selected_down: the selected tracks one
   place up or down in a playlist or the Auto DJ queue (the view's
   Alt+Up/Down), for a touch screen without drag and drop.
Author: DecksmithOS
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-24
